#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.rst:5
msgid "Installation"
msgstr "Instalación"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.rst:6
msgid ""
"Install the base Xinference package with ``pip`` on Linux, Windows, or "
"macOS::"
msgstr ""
"Instala el paquete base de Xinference con ``pip`` en Linux, Windows o "
"macOS::"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.rst:10
msgid ""
"Model virtual environments install supported engine dependencies on demand. "
"To install a backend manually, use its corresponding extra; see "
":ref:`inference_backend`."
msgstr ""
"Los entornos virtuales de los modelos instalan las dependencias de los "
"motores compatibles cuando se necesitan. Para instalar un backend "
"manualmente, usa su extra correspondiente; consulta "
":ref:`inference_backend`."

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.rst:127
msgid ""
"These dependencies can change versions of shared packages such as "
"``transformers``. Install only the backend dependencies you need in an "
"isolated environment."
msgstr ""
"Estas dependencias pueden cambiar las versiones de paquetes compartidos como"
" ``transformers``. Instala solo las dependencias del backend que necesites "
"en un entorno aislado."

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.rst:41
msgid "Transformers Backend"
msgstr "Transformers engine"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.rst:46
msgid "Notes:"
msgstr "**Nota:**"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.rst:48
msgid ""
"The transformers engine supports ``pytorch`` / ``gptq`` / ``awq`` / "
"``bnb`` / ``fp4`` formats."
msgstr ""
"El motor de Transformers soporta los formatos ``pytorch`` / ``gptq`` / "
"``awq`` / ``bnb`` / ``fp4``."

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.rst:54
msgid "vLLM Backend"
msgstr "El motor vLLM"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.rst:55
msgid ""
"vLLM is a fast and easy-to-use library for LLM inference and serving. "
"Xinference will choose vLLM as the backend to achieve better throughput "
"when the following conditions are met:"
msgstr ""
"vLLM es un motor de inferencia de modelos grandes de alto rendimiento que"
" admite alta concurrencia. Cuando se cumplen las siguientes condiciones, "
"Xinference selecciona automáticamente vllm como motor para lograr un "
"mayor rendimiento:"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.rst:57
msgid ""
"The model format is ``pytorch``, ``gptq``, ``awq``, ``fp4``, ``fp8`` or "
"``bnb``."
msgstr ""
"El formato del modelo es ``pytorch``, ``gptq``, ``awq``, ``fp4``, ``fp8``"
" o ``bnb``."

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.rst:58
msgid "When the model format is ``pytorch``, the quantization is ``none``."
msgstr ""
"Cuando el formato del modelo es ``pytorch``, la opción de cuantificación "
"debe ser ``none``."

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.rst:59
msgid "When the model format is ``awq``, the quantization is ``Int4``."
msgstr ""
"Cuando el formato del modelo sea ``awq``, la opción de cuantización debe "
"ser ``Int4``."

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.rst:60
msgid ""
"When the model format is ``gptq``, the quantization is ``Int3``, ``Int4``"
" or ``Int8``."
msgstr ""
"Cuando el formato del modelo sea ``gptq``, las opciones de cuantización "
"deben ser ``Int3``, ``Int4`` o ``Int8``."

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.rst:61
msgid "The system is Linux and has at least one CUDA device"
msgstr ""
"El sistema operativo es Linux y tiene al menos un dispositivo compatible "
"con CUDA."

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.rst:62
msgid ""
"The model family (for custom models) / model name (for builtin models) is"
" within the list of models supported by vLLM"
msgstr ""
"Los campos ``model_family`` de los modelos personalizados y "
"``model_name`` de los modelos integrados están en la lista de soporte de "
"vLLM."

