msgid "Install Xinference with ``pip`` on Linux, Windows, or macOS::"
msgstr "Instale Xinference con ``pip`` en Linux, Windows o macOS::"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.rst:11
msgid "Automatic engine installation"
msgstr "Instalación automática de motores"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.rst:12
msgid ""
"Model virtual environments are enabled by default. When you launch a "
"model, Xinference prepares a virtual environment for that model and engine"
" and automatically installs the dependencies declared by its "
"configuration. You do not need to install ``xinference[all]`` or an engine"
" extra first."
msgstr ""
"Los entornos virtuales de los modelos están activados de forma "
"predeterminada. Al iniciar un modelo, Xinference prepara un entorno "
"virtual para ese modelo y su motor e instala automáticamente las "
"dependencias declaradas en su configuración. No es necesario instalar "
"previamente ``xinference[all]`` ni un extra de motor."

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.rst:17
msgid ""
"This applies to engines such as Transformers, vLLM, SGLang, llama.cpp, and"
" MLX. Choose a supported engine when launching the model; Xinference "
"manages its Python dependencies. The engine's operating system, hardware, "
"and driver requirements still apply."
msgstr ""
"Esto se aplica a motores como Transformers, vLLM, SGLang, llama.cpp y MLX."
" Elija un motor compatible al iniciar el modelo; Xinference gestiona sus "
"dependencias de Python. Los requisitos del motor en cuanto a sistema "
"operativo, hardware y controladores siguen siendo aplicables."

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.rst:22
msgid ""
"The first launch may take longer while packages are downloaded and "
"installed. Later launches reuse the prepared environment when its "
"dependencies are unchanged. The Worker needs access to the configured "
"package indexes, or a prepared offline package source. See "
":ref:`model_virtual_env` for dependency overrides and local wheel sources,"
" and :ref:`using_docker_compose` for offline deployments."
msgstr ""
"El primer inicio puede tardar más mientras se descargan e instalan los "
"paquetes. Los siguientes inicios reutilizan el entorno preparado si las "
"dependencias no cambian. El Worker necesita acceso a los índices de "
"paquetes configurados o a una fuente de paquetes sin conexión preparada "
"previamente. Consulte :ref:`model_virtual_env` para sobrescribir "
"dependencias y usar fuentes locales de wheels, y "
":ref:`using_docker_compose` para despliegues sin conexión."

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.rst:28
msgid ""
"The following sections describe the available engines. Manual installation"
" is covered in :ref:`manual_backend_installation` for deployments that "
"disable model virtual environments."
msgstr ""
"Las siguientes secciones describen los motores disponibles. Para "
"despliegues que desactivan los entornos virtuales de los modelos, la "
"instalación manual se explica en :ref:`manual_backend_installation`."

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.rst:37
msgid ""
"PyTorch (transformers) supports the inference of most state-of-art models."
" It is the default backend for models in PyTorch format."
msgstr ""
"PyTorch (transformers) permite la inferencia de la mayoría de los modelos "
"más avanzados. Es el backend predeterminado para los modelos en formato "
"PyTorch."

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.rst:42
msgid ""
"FP4 format requires ``transformers`` with ``FPQuantConfig`` support. Use "
":ref:`model_virtual_env` to override dependencies for a model when needed."
msgstr ""
"El formato FP4 requiere ``transformers`` con soporte para "
"``FPQuantConfig``. Consulte :ref:`model_virtual_env` para sobrescribir las"
" dependencias de un modelo cuando sea necesario."

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.rst:101
msgid ""
"With model virtual environments enabled, Xinference installs the "
"configured vLLM dependencies at launch. No separate vLLM or FlashInfer "
"installation command is required for this path."
msgstr ""
"Con los entornos virtuales de los modelos activados, Xinference instala "
"las dependencias de vLLM configuradas al iniciar el modelo. Este "
"procedimiento no requiere un comando de instalación independiente de vLLM "
"o FlashInfer."

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.rst:127
msgid ""
"Select ``SGLang`` as the engine when launching a supported model. "
"Xinference installs the configured SGLang dependencies in that model's "
"virtual environment; you do not need to install ``xinference[sglang]`` "
"separately."
msgstr ""
"Seleccione ``SGLang`` como motor al iniciar un modelo compatible. "
"Xinference instala las dependencias de SGLang configuradas en el entorno "
"virtual de ese modelo; no es necesario instalar ``xinference[sglang]`` por"
" separado."

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.rst:136
msgid ""
"Xinference installs the configured MLX dependencies automatically when you"
" launch a supported model with the MLX engine."
msgstr ""
"Xinference instala automáticamente las dependencias de MLX configuradas al"
" iniciar un modelo compatible con el motor MLX."

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.rst:140
msgid "Optional components"
msgstr "Componentes opcionales"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.rst:144
msgid ""
"Token Router is an optional component for routing requests across model "
"replicas. It is not required to install Xinference or launch models. If "
"your deployment uses the Token Router Runtime or Router Agent, install the"
" ``router`` extra in the environment where those processes run::"
msgstr ""
"Token Router es un componente opcional para enrutar solicitudes entre "
"réplicas de modelos. No es necesario para instalar Xinference ni iniciar "
"modelos. Si su despliegue utiliza Token Router Runtime o Router Agent, "
"instale el extra ``router`` en el entorno donde se ejecutan esos "
"procesos::"

