#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.rst:6
msgid ""
"Xinference can be installed with the :ref:`one-command installer "
"<one_line_install>` or :ref:`pip <pip_installation>`. Choose the installer "
"for a managed tool environment, or pip to use an existing Python "
"environment."
msgstr ""
"Xinference se puede instalar con el :ref:`instalador de un solo comando "
"<one_line_install>` o con :ref:`pip <pip_installation>`. Elija el instalador"
" para un entorno de herramientas gestionado, o pip para usar un entorno de "
"Python existente."
